Slightly OT, but I thought I'd share the (spoily) discovery I made
today with you all.

A hungry doppleganger needs only polymorph into a rock more, and dig a
few tunnels. You'll have a stomach full of yummy dirt in next to no
time. Rock moles seem to be quite easy to poly into (providing you
have the necessary 20 Pow points) even if you haven't eaten one, and
although they're slow, weak and can't carry all your gear, they do at
least have a half- decent AC so you can usually ride out a few hits
until your pet gets there to help you out.

